    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the cursor in a Bullet Hell! Cosmic battles, chaotic gameplay, and awesome upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Dodge, slice, survive in outer space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Forget traditional ship controls. In Cursor Survival, you </i>are* the cursor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Evade a deadly rain of lasers and projectiles, maneuvering with pinpoint accuracy in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Slice enemy ships to pieces like a katana, tearing through hordes of opponents in vibrant cosmic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Survive wave after wave, honing your skills and collecting valuable upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong> Innovative cursor-based control in classic Bullet Hell action, set in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>High Replayability:</strong> 38 upgrades allow you to create diverse cursor builds and experience a fresh game every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Diverse Cosmic &quot;Armaments&quot;:</strong> From a &quot;beam of light&quot; that incinerates ships to powerful blasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Dynamic and Challenging Gameplay:</strong> Test your survival skills and quick decision-making in intense space battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Vibrant Visual Style:</strong> Enjoy colorful cosmic backdrops and stylish enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Energetic happy hardcore/scenecore soundtrack:</strong> Keep up with the insane pace of the game with dynamic music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master the intricacies of control and transform your cursor into the deadliest weapon in the universe!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become a cursor master and survive all the waves of chaos in the vast expanse of space? Add Cursor Survival to your library and prepare for a Bullet Hell frenzy where the ultimate weapon is\u2026 the cursor!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the cursor in a Bullet Hell! Cosmic battles, chaotic gameplay, and awesome upgrades!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Dodge, slice, survive in outer space!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <i>Forget traditional ship controls. In Cursor Survival, you </i>are* the cursor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Evade a deadly rain of lasers and projectiles, maneuvering with pinpoint accuracy in the depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Slice enemy ships to pieces like a katana, tearing through hordes of opponents in vibrant cosmic environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 Survive wave after wave, honing your skills and collecting valuable upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Unique Gameplay:</strong> Innovative cursor-based control in classic Bullet Hell action, set in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>High Replayability:</strong> 38 upgrades allow you to create diverse cursor builds and experience a fresh game every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Diverse Cosmic &quot;Armaments&quot;:</strong> From a &quot;beam of light&quot; that incinerates ships to powerful blasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Dynamic and Challenging Gameplay:</strong> Test your survival skills and quick decision-making in intense space battles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Vibrant Visual Style:</strong> Enjoy colorful cosmic backdrops and stylish enemy ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0\u2022 <strong>Energetic happy hardcore/scenecore soundtrack:</strong> Keep up with the insane pace of the game with dynamic music!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Master the intricacies of control and transform your cursor into the deadliest weapon in the universe!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you become a cursor master and survive all the waves of chaos in the vast expanse of space? Add Cursor Survival to your library and prepare for a Bullet Hell frenzy where the ultimate weapon is\u2026 the cursor!</p>",
    "short_description": "Prepare for a radical shift in Bullet Hell gameplay! In Cursor Survival, you're not piloting a character - you embody the... CURSOR! Unleash a new, utterly insane way to evade, strike, and endure in a chaotic universe of projectiles and adversaries.",
